## 3. Password Reset → Profile Flow ✅ (Code Verified)

The flow is implemented in [App.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/App.tsx#L72-L79):

1. Employee clicks invite link in email
2. [App.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/App.tsx) detects `type=invite` or `PASSWORD_RECOVERY` event
3. Shows [SetPasswordScreen](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/components/SetPasswordScreen.tsx)
4. After password set → auto-redirects `member` role to Portal

